# ---- web_vault operator token (bin/web-vault.sh, BH-7595) ----
# The second credential the web_vault set, entries and audit routes need on top
# of HARNESS_SECRET (every lane-run machine holds that one, so it cannot mean
# "operator"). Set it in the HUB env only, never on a box or a lane-run machine.
# The same value is the jobs worker secret WEB_VAULT_ADMIN_TOKEN
# (`wrangler secret put WEB_VAULT_ADMIN_TOKEN --name harness-jobs`). Unset on the
# worker = every operator route answers 403. The encryption keys are worker
# secrets only (WEB_VAULT_KEY_<n>, base64 of 32 bytes) and never sit in an env file.
#WEB_VAULT_ADMIN_TOKEN=
